entity-description-GasVolumePumpHighFlow = A reinforced volumetric pump, able to move gas at three times the rate of a standard volumetric pump.

entity-name-GasDualPortVentPumpHighFlow = high-flow dual-port air vent
entity-description-GasDualPortVentPumpHighFlow = A reinforced dual-port vent, able to pressurize and siphon far past the rating of a standard vent.

entity-name-GasFilterHighFlow = high-flow gas filter
